    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIMENSIONS AND BIOMES:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple Dimensions and their completely unique biomes via the Dimensional Portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESOURCES COLLECTION: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Dimension and biome has its own nature and enemies that allow you to obtain unique natural resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRUCTURES: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small buildings that can perform a wide variety of tasks, from extracting minerals from mines and crafting new items to generating and distributing electricit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUTOMATION:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drones to automate all your structures, from furnaces and extractors to power plants and electric turbines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROPS, TRADER AND CRAFTSMAN: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow multiple crops, sell them to the Traveling Merchant, earn money in return, and have the Artisan craft high-level structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOTOR DIMENSIONAL:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress, unlock new materials and high-level structures, and build the greatest invention in the universe, the &quot;DIMENSIONAL ENGINE&quot;.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIMENSIONS AND BIOMES:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple Dimensions and their completely unique biomes via the Dimensional Portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESOURCES COLLECTION: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Dimension and biome has its own nature and enemies that allow you to obtain unique natural resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRUCTURES: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small buildings that can perform a wide variety of tasks, from extracting minerals from mines and crafting new items to generating and distributing electricit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUTOMATION:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drones to automate all your structures, from furnaces and extractors to power plants and electric turbines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROPS, TRADER AND CRAFTSMAN: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow multiple crops, sell them to the Traveling Merchant, earn money in return, and have the Artisan craft high-level structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOTOR DIMENSIONAL:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress, unlock new materials and high-level structures, and build the greatest invention in the universe, the &quot;DIMENSIONAL ENGINE&quot;.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Travel to multiple completely unique dimensions, gather their unique natural resources, build new structures and buildings, craft high-level materials, and automate everything. In doing so, you will be able to complete your ultimate goal: constructing the &quot;Dimensional Engine&quot;.",
